   <string>256-bit VPHADDD Instruction Operation</string></para>
  </longdesc>
 <subsection title="Intel C/C++ Compiler Intrinsic Equivalents">
  <programlisting><string>PHADDW __m64 _mm_hadd_pi16 (__m64 a, __m64 b)</string><string>
</string><string>PHADDD __m64 _mm_hadd_pi32 (__m64 a, __m64 b)</string><string>
</string><string>(V)PHADDW __m128i _mm_hadd_epi16 (__m128i a, __m128i b)</string><string>
</string><string>(V)PHADDD __m128i _mm_hadd_epi32 (__m128i a, __m128i b)</string><string>
</string><string>VPHADDW 		__m256i _mm256_hadd_epi16 (__m256i a, __m256i b)</string><string>
</string><string>VPHADDD 		__m256i _mm256_hadd_epi32 (__m256i a, __m256i b)</string><string>
</string></programlisting>
  </subsection>
